# Four analytical pairs of half-margins (16 interval predicates) cover
# identity, expansion, contraction and independent incident-class epochs.
# Four further predicates require a partial SW refresh never to shrink an
# inactive group's allowance. Intervals are [reference-1e-11, reference].
# RUN: mdir-water-template-test --validity-ir | mlir-opt --convert-scf-to-cf --convert-cf-to-llvm %lower_to_llvm | mlir-runner -e water_limits_main --entry-point-result=void --shared-libs=%mlir_c_runner_utils
